<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>GlassFolders</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>GlassFolders 0.7.4 Beta 3.0</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Beta 3.0：只重做 Clear 的强度逻辑。进入 Clear 后从 0% 开始就保持高透亮、低灰雾的基础状态；滑杆不再把画面从灰闷慢慢推亮，而主要增加局部模糊、颜色/层次分离、边缘高光与光学结构。打开态 100% 仍保持约 40pt Gaussian 上限。Liquid Glass 沿用 Beta 2.8 已确认基线，不做调整。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>风格</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Clear：颜色只来自真实壁纸/backdrop，不添加紫、蓝、粉等彩色 tint。Clear 本身从最低强度就保持干净透亮；强度提高时主要增加模糊、色彩分离与边缘/高光结构，而不是明显增加白色透光。Liquid Glass：保持既有较厚玻璃的 saturation、白色透光与镜面高光基线。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Style</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>Clear</string>
				<string>Liquid Glass</string>
			</array>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Clear 强度</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>只用于 Clear。0% 已经保持高透亮/低灰雾，只是不额外增加局部模糊与结构；往上主要增加 Gaussian 模糊、颜色/层次分离和边缘高光，100% 打开态仍约 40pt。透亮本身只做小幅变化，避免低档闷灰、高档又只是变白。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>cellClass</key>
			<string>GFPercentSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ClearStrength</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>55</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Liquid Glass 强度</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>只用于 Liquid Glass。继续控制 blur、saturation、白色透光与镜面高光等综合玻璃响应。与 Clear 强度分开记忆。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>cellClass</key>
			<string>GFPercentSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>LiquidGlassStrength</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>55</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.glassfolders</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<false/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>关闭文件夹的 Liquid Glass 现在完整恢复到此前真机确认满意的较浅基线：原 blur / saturation、中性 brightness、白色透光、被动 SBHLibraryCategoryPodBackgroundView blend 与关闭态光照图均保持该基线。不主动调用 _updateVisualStyle；真实 App 资源库本身不会被 hook 或修改。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>应用并注销</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>respring</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>关于</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSTitleValueCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>作者</string>
			<key>get</key>
			<string>authorValue:</string>
		</dict>
